& =2pt \\\\ t & =-\\frac{3}{2p}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation and solving for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3 & =p{(-\\frac{3}{2p})}^{2} \\\\ -3 & =p\\cdot \\frac{9}{4{p}^{2}} \\\\ -3 & =\\frac{9}{4p} \\\\ 4p & =-3 \\\\ p & =-\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the parabola are\n\n$$\nx=2(-\\frac{3}{4})t,\\,y=(-\\frac{3}{4}){t}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhich simplify to\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{3}{2}t,\\,y=-\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{2}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088514 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186088534 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088514 #edb/ref 1061 16069 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088514 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "22697b73-625d-545a-ba00-223291b29933" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088514 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186088889 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088515 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186088522 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088515 #edb/ref 1061 16070 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088515 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b1b7d3eb-f611-589c-99d3-92b8c28fd2c4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088515 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186087693 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088516 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186088549 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088516 #edb/ref 1061 16073 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088516 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "17d76850-618a-5b25-88fc-fc5296c2deb2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088516 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186087694 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088522 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186088516 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088522 #edb/ref 1061 16114 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088522 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1f0e819b-30a9-5921-8910-450a2910edb7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088522 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186088891 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088534 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186088515 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088534 #edb/ref 1061 16855 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186088534 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "15b361ac-babf-50db-b55f-4a4